    {
      "day": 9,
      "line": "★ IDENTIFIED: Pokeweed. Smooth stalks, purple-red stems, dark berry clusters. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."
    },
    {
      "day": 13,
      "line": "Word reaches you, days late: Sofia stands accused over what happened to Lena. There's going to be a moot. People are choosing sides."
    },
    {
      "day": 15,
      "line": "Lena has been talking at the fires. Enough voices — tonight they call a moot. Sofia answers for what happened to Lena."
    },
    {
      "day": 15,
      "line": "Lena calls the moot. The fire gets built up — word travels fast, and almost everyone comes."
    },
    {
      "day": 15,
      "line": "The moot turns to you. Your vote matters here — and everyone will remember it."
    },
    {
      "day": 17,
      "line": "The moot doesn't wait forever. Two days of silence from the fire's edge — the count is taken without you."
    },
    {
      "day": 17,
      "line": "The fire is built high. Nobody speaks while the count is taken — you can hear the wind past the edge of the light."
    },
    {
      "day": 17,
      "line": "Kofi counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"1 for guilty. 5 against.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 17,
      "line": "A long exhale moves around the fire like weather. \"Not guilty — this time.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 30,
      "line": "💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Lockpick: Buy it off. It steals FIRST and fights second — but it CANNOT resist food. OFFER FOOD in the fight: it drops your things mid-scamper for the meal. A bribe is cheaper than a chase. (Two survived encounters — the fire has a theory.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 30,
      "line": "📓 Codex: Counter: Buy it off — It steals FIRST and fights second — but it CANNOT resist food. OFFER FOOD in the fight: it drops your things mid-scamper for the meal. A bribe is cheaper than a chase."
    },
    {
      "day": 34,
      "line": "Lena spends the afternoon with the tree with orange fruit, soft when ripe — look, smell, the smallest taste, then waiting. Edible, but it argues on the way down. The fire's verdict: food, carefully. Small amounts."
    },
    {
      "day": 63,
      "line": "📖 Codex: Confrontation — charges in a straight line, trampling everything in its path. You won't forget this."
