    {
      "day": 77,
      "line": "Travel 3 tiles to trail edge.\n— An old trail —\nThe trail is worn smooth as an old coin. Deer, probably. Probably."
    },
    {
      "day": 82,
      "line": "⚖️ The ruling seats: the Scroll swells on precedent (+40 HP); its jurisdiction settles over your body (−10 max HP, this fight)."
    },
    {
      "day": 116,
      "line": "🔍 Zhasulan crouches over tiny three-cornered nuts in spiny husks, under trees with smooth gray bark, studying it a moment before moving on. (2/3 looks)"
    },
    {
      "day": 119,
      "line": "🔍 Zhasulan has been turning over tiny three-cornered nuts in spiny husks, under trees with smooth gray bark for days — today it clicked. \"I know this one now. Look — see the leaves?\""
    },
    {
      "day": 120,
      "line": "Vanessa showed Viviana the tiny three-cornered nuts in spiny husks, under trees with smooth gray bark — \"remember it.\" The haven hears about it by supper."
    },
    {
      "day": 120,
      "line": "★ IDENTIFIED: Beechnut. Small three-sided nuts in spiny little cases under the smooth gray-barked trees. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."
